</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>LeapIn Talent SaaS</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Dear User,</p>
        <p>You requested to reset your LeapIn Talent SaaS login password. Please open the link below to continue:</p>
        <div class="link">
            <a href="<%= url %>" target="_blank" style="color: #2A5CAA; text-decoration: underline;">Open reset password page</a>
        </div>
        <p>If the link does not work, copy and paste the following URL into your browser:</p>
        <div class="link" style="color: #2A5CAA; text-decoration: underline;"><%= url %></div>
        <div class="warning">
            <strong>Security tips:</strong><br>
            • This link will expire in 3 minutes<br>
            • Do not share it with anyone<br>
            • If this was not you, contact your administrator immediately
        </div>
